1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,833
Now you walk to the palm, and you read
the plank.

2
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:05,833
Rule one. Sit down. Count what you
have.

3
00:00:06,333 --> 00:00:10,600
So you sit. One shoe. One paper
umbrella. One inhaler, four puffs
left.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,500
Gray wood. Cracked. Twenty years of
sun.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,133
But those footprints are ten minutes
old.

6
00:00:16,633 --> 00:00:20,400
And in the corner of the plank,
somebody carved a crooked little star.

7
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,867
I know that star. My sister drew it on
everything.
